# Translation of Odoo Server.
# This file contains the translation of the following modules:
# 	* partner_microsite_manager
#
# Scope is the footer only, on purpose.
#
# The footer of every microsite and every zone is this module's own template,
# which has no website_id, so website_auto_translate leaves it alone -- and
# rightly so: translating an addon's view in the database would fight the
# module on every update. Its wording belongs here instead.
#
# The legal pages are deliberately NOT translated. A privacy policy or a set of
# terms and conditions run through a machine translator is a liability, not a
# service, and Spanish is the language they were written and reviewed in.
#
# There is an en.po, and it only became safe to ship one once the base was
# protected. Odoo keeps en_US as the technical base of a translatable column,
# and this module's views held their Spanish there with no es_ES entry of their
# own; an en.po written before that would have overwritten the base, which is
# precisely how 2134 records lost their Spanish on 2026-08-14. The
# post-migration in 19.0.1.7.0 gives the Spanish a key of its own first, and it
# has to be a post-migration because that is the only point where the records
# exist and en_US still holds the Spanish the XML just wrote.
#
# Every language file in this directory is generated from this one, so this
# note reads the same in all of them and only has to be corrected once.
#
